Think this is a regression from https://github.com/rails/rails/commit/de13ed9ec740feaa5fdb48f338d36581d7ce2e3f

Symbols *were* kind of supported when doing 

```
@other_subscribers.reject! { |s| s.matches?(subscriber_or_name) }
```

Easier to get that behavior back in case of *other* non-string subscribers.
